SUMMARY:Leadership on Tap
DESCRIPTION:AVL Digital Nomads\nIn this engaging workshop\, Mike Archbold 
 explores why even the best strategies often fail during execution. Drawing
  on his experience leading complex IoT engineering teams\, Mike shares pra
 ctical approaches for creating clarity\, alignment\, and accountability. P
 articipants will learn how to translate vision into action\, enabling team
 s to execute with confidence\, focus\, and measurable results.\n\n**Specia
 l discount on ADN engraved Pirani cups!**\n**Your paid ticket gets you $10
  off our 5th-anniversary custom [ADN Pirani cups](https://avldigitalnomads
 .org/meet-our-brand-new-customized-adn-pirani-mugs/)! Available in 16oz\, 
 26oz\, and 32oz sizes\, you can select yours directly at this event.**\n\n
 Everyone! Whether you're leading in for-profit\, non-profit\, academia\, c
 ommunity organizations\, or entrepreneurship – or simply curious about l
 eadership – you're welcome to join us.\n\n* Hatch Coworking\n* Parking: 
 Street parking is free after 6 pm\n* Beverages: Alcoholic and non-alcoholi
 c beverages
